Soo-saar qor: (['a:b:'] - [':']), sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: (['Lorem Ipsum'] - ['Ipsum']), sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: (['a.................b.......................c...........'] - ['.']), sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: (['a--b--c---d'] - ['--']), sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: (['-'] - ['--']), sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: ([''] - ['--']), sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: (['--'] - ['']), sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: ([''] - ['']), sadar-cusub.
>> x := ['xx'].
>> y := x - ['x'].
Soo-saar qor: x, sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: y, sadar-cusub.
>> x := ['a,bb,c'].
>> y := x beddel: [''] ku: ['xx'].
Soo-saar qor: ((x isku-mid: y) kan: ['OK'] ama-kaas: ['BUG! Did return a copy by accident!']), sadar-cusub.